!!! oculus/appearance/appearance.mat
!!! The appearance layer — ties theme, style, and accessibility together.
!!!
!!! This is the top-level abstraction that the compositor uses
!!! to determine how to render the scene.

book oculus.appearance.appearance

read everything from oculus.appearance.theme
read everything from oculus.appearance.style
read everything from oculus.appearance.accessibility
read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! The complete appearance configuration.

public appearance-config begin record
    field theme as text
    field style as style-rules
    field accessibility as accessibility-config
    field is-ready as boolean
end record
